{"version":1,"content":"<p>MIRROR成員呂爵安（Edan）的餅印胞妹「小如豬」呂蕙如生日，Edan雖然工作忙碌，但每年都抽空陪妹妹慶祝，昨天（30日）Edan在社交平台分享幾張和妹妹慶祝生日照片，其中一張作狀親妹妹面珠，十分搞笑。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:12.869491+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":103,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T04:42:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:42.063488+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:42.063488+00:00","content_hash":"be33570f3a591ece56b77f7359671bcff6a553eb66f10f77f5521d5a38667ee7","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}